  lines:
  - Rain on the windows.\nSmoke in the air.\nAnd a table with one empty chair.
  - You didn't come here for luck...\nbut luck came looking for you.
  - The man across the table doesn't smile.\nHe doesn't blink, either.
  - '"Everyone in this room has a number," he says.\n"Most of them are wrong."'
  - He slides six dice across the felt.\nOne of them is yours.
  - Choose carefully, friend.\nThe house always remembers.
  music: {fileID: 1414578819}
  musicVolume: 0.6
  fadeInTime: 2
  fadeOutTime: 1.5
  holdBase: 1.2
  holdPerChar: 0.035
  lights: {fileID: 479386793}
  mainSceneName: Main
